    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n76784" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πᾰλαιστής</span></b>  (A), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλαίω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wrestler</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				8.246
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
